== Usage ==
=== Private Island ===
'''Droppers''' can be placed as a block on the player's {{Zone|Private Island}}. When activated from a [[Redstone]] signal, it will [[mcw:Dropper#Usage|drop an item]] from its inventory, but there are [[Private Island#Redstone Restrictions|restrictions]] on how often this can be done. Droppers cannot be placed in {{Zone|The Garden}}.

